      "description": "Actual Series 1 quarantine appearance; never implies scoring readiness.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-series\" dir=\"rtl\"><div class=\"ds-series-head\"><bdi class=\"ds-tile\" dir=\"ltr\">1</bdi><span class=\"ds-series-badge\">بانتظار التحقق</span></div><h3>السلسلة 1</h3><p>صور الأسئلة متاحة. الإجابات الصحيحة لم تُتحقق من المصدر بعد.</p><a href=\"#\" class=\"ds-series-action\">مراجعة محتوى السلسلة</a></article>",
      "css": ".ds-series{background:var(--surface,#103a71);color:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;max-width:320px;font-family:\"Noto Sans Arabic\",sans-serif;line-height:1.85;font-size:15px}.ds-series-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px}.ds-tile{display:grid;place-items:center;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff6d9;color:#775000;font-size:20px;font-weight:600}.ds-series-badge{background:#fff1ce;color:#775000;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:8px;font-size:11px}.ds-series h3{font:600 17px/1.6 \"Noto Kufi Arabic\",sans-serif;margin:0}.ds-series p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#c4d6ee);margin:0}.ds-series-action{min-height:48px;border:1px solid var(--line,#315a8d);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 20px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.6;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s;font-family:\"Noto Sans Arabic\",sans-serif;min-height:44px;background:#fff;color:#104691;border:0;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;padding:9px 14px}.ds-series-action:hover{background:#fff1ce}.ds-series-action:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ffd575;outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-series-action{transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Home destination",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "home-path",
      "description": "Royal blue destination with white circular line icon and left arrow.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-path\" href=\"#\" dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"ds-path-icon\"><svg width=\"29\" height=\"29\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5Z\"/><path d=\"m3 12 9 5 9-5M3 16l9 5 9-5\"/></svg></span><span><h2>سلاسل الامتحان</h2><p>تدرّب على أسئلة الامتحان، سلسلة بعد سلسلة</p></span><svg class=\"ds-path-arrow\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 12H4m6-6-6 6 6 6\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-path{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;min-height:154px;border-radius:16px;padding:26px;background:var(--royal,#1552ac);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 26px #00173335;transition:background .15s;text-decoration:none;font-family:\"Noto Sans Arabic\",sans-serif;line-height:1.85;}.ds-path:hover{background:#2163bd}.ds-path-icon{width:64px;height:64px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;color:#1552ac;flex-shrink:0}.ds-path h2{font:600 20px/1.6 \"Noto Kufi Arabic\",sans-serif;margin:0 0 8px}.ds-path p{font-size:13px;color:#dae7fc;margin:0;max-width:34ch}.ds-path-arrow{margin-inline-start:auto;flex-shrink:0}.ds-path:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ffd575;outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-path{transition:none!important}}@media(max-width:520px){.ds-path{min-height:134px;padding:22px;gap:16px}.ds-path-icon{width:56px;height:56px}.ds-path h2{font-size:19px}.ds-path p{font-size:12px;max-width:28ch}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Corrected answer keys",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "answer-correct",
      "description": "Persistent red/green correction with Latin digits, icons and full opacity.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-answers\" aria-label=\"الإجابات\"><button class=\"ds-answer ds-wrong\" disabled aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"الإجابة 1\"><bdi dir=\"ltr\">1</bdi><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 6-12 12M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-answer ds-correct\" disabled aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"الإجابة 2\"><bdi dir=\"ltr\">2</bdi><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m20 6-11 11-5-5\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-answer\" disabled aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"الإجابة 3\">3</button><button class=\"ds-answer\" disabled aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"الإجابة 4\">4</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-answers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;direction:ltr}.ds-answer{position:relative;min-height:86px;border:2px solid #356ac4;border-radius:12px;background:var(--royal,#1552ac);color:#fff;font:600 32px/1.85 \"Noto Sans Arabic\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s}.ds-answer:hover:not(:disabled){background:#2163bd}.ds-answer[aria-pressed=true]{background:#ffc34a;border-color:#ffc34a;color:#082b5a}.ds-answer.ds-correct{background:var(--green,#126e46);border-color:#51ba81;color:#fff}.ds-answer.ds-wrong{background:var(--red,#b62536);border-color:#ff8290;color:#fff}.ds-answer:disabled{opacity:1;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-answer:disabled.ds-correct,.ds-answer:disabled.ds-wrong{cursor:default}.ds-answer svg{position:absolute;top:6px;right:6px}.ds-answer bdi{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}.ds-answer:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ffd575;outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-answer{transition:none!important}}@media(max-width:520px){.ds-answers{gap:10px}.ds-answer{min-height:80px;font-size:30px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Correction feedback",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "feedback-error",
      "description": "Arabic text/icon verdict, chosen and correct answers, and correction download.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-feedback\" dir=\"rtl\" role=\"status\"><strong><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 6-12 12M6 6l12 12\"/></svg>إجابة خاطئة</strong><p>إجابتك: <bdi dir=\"ltr\">1</bdi><br>الإجابة الصحيحة: <bdi dir=\"ltr\">2</bdi></p><button class=\"ds-download\" type=\"button\">تنزيل التصحيح</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-feedback{border-radius:12px;padding:18px 22px;margin-top:20px;background:#ffe5e8;color:#9b1428;font-family:\"Noto Sans Arabic\",sans-serif;line-height:1.85;font-size:15px}.ds-feedback strong{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:18px}.ds-feedback p{font-size:14px;margin:10px 0 0}.ds-feedback bdi{display:inline-block;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}.ds-download{min-height:48px;border:1px solid var(--line,#315a8d);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 20px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.6;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s;font-family:\"Noto Sans Arabic\",sans-serif;background:#fff;color:#082b5a;border-color:#caa4af;font-size:12px;min-height:44px;padding:9px 14px;margin-top:14px}.ds-download:hover{background:#235a9b}.ds-download:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ffd575;outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-download{transition:none!important}}@media(max-width:520px){.ds-feedback{padding:16px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "طريقي — the blue road to practice",
    "overview": "A confident Arabic driving-practice interface built around a deep blue canvas, royal blue destinations and warm yellow actions. The user's pinned direction overrides the earlier seed (15144445) and the previous light study interface. This is a record of the implemented system, not a proposal for another theme.\n\nWhite Arabic typography sits above faint original road-sign outlines. The original question image remains the visual authority during practice; large numbered answer keys and persistent correction states give the learning loop a clear rhythm. UI text reads right to left, while utility numbers use Latin digits and isolated left-to-right expressions.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Deep blue surroundings, royal blue cards, white type and yellow actions.",
      "Local Arabic heading and body fonts with Latin utility digits.",
      "Six colorful home destinations and an image-led practice surface.",
      "Explicit correction through text, icons and color."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Correction Clarity Rule",
        "body": "Pair correction color with Arabic text and a check or cross; locked answer keys retain full opacity.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Reading Direction Rule",
        "body": "Keep Arabic text RTL. Format utility digits through src/lib/numbers.ts and isolate composite numeric expressions with Numeric; answer keys stay in 1–4 left-to-right order.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Source Truth Rule",
        "body": "Show unverified series as awaiting verification with a content-review link. Never style source availability as scoreable readiness.",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** preserve the user-pinned blue, white and yellow world and the faint original road-sign pattern.",
      "**Do** keep Arabic text RTL and Latin numeric expressions isolated through Numeric.",
      "**Do** display the complete source question image with zoom access, four multi-select keys and a separate confirmation action.",
      "**Do** preserve text, icon and color correction, full-opacity locked keys, visible focus and reduced-motion support.",
      "**Do** retain truthful awaiting-verification cards and empty states; Series 1 has images but remains blocked from scoring until its answer keys are verified."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** restore the stale light palette or Eastern-digit formatting.",
      "**Don't** crop the source question, invent answer keys or explanations, or fabricate progress.",
      "**Don't** turn the yellow action color into a default surface for every card.",
      "**Don't** describe all controls as at least 44px: the desktop question-navigation grid currently uses 40px keys."
    ]
  }
}